[
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 1,
    "global_ayah_id": 5376,
    "translation": "有人曾請求一種將發生的刑罰。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 2,
    "global_ayah_id": 5377,
    "translation": "那是為不信的人們而預定的，沒有任何人能加以抵抗。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 3,
    "global_ayah_id": 5378,
    "translation": "那是真主——天梯的主宰——發出的，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 4,
    "global_ayah_id": 5379,
    "translation": "眾天神和精神在一日之內升到他那裡。那一日的長度是五萬年。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 5,
    "global_ayah_id": 5380,
    "translation": "你安然地忍受吧。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 6,
    "global_ayah_id": 5381,
    "translation": "他們以為那刑罰是很遠的，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 7,
    "global_ayah_id": 5382,
    "translation": "我卻以為那是很近的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 8,
    "global_ayah_id": 5383,
    "translation": "在那日天像熔銅，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 9,
    "global_ayah_id": 5384,
    "translation": "山像彩絨。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 10,
    "global_ayah_id": 5385,
    "translation": "親戚相見不相同。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 11,
    "global_ayah_id": 5386,
    "translation": "罪人願意贖取那日的刑罰，即使犧牲他的兒女、"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 12,
    "global_ayah_id": 5387,
    "translation": "他的妻子、他的弟兄，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 13,
    "global_ayah_id": 5388,
    "translation": "和那收容他的血族，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 14,
    "global_ayah_id": 5389,
    "translation": "以及大地上所有的人，但願那能拯救自己。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 15,
    "global_ayah_id": 5390,
    "translation": "絕不然，那確是發焰的烈火，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 16,
    "global_ayah_id": 5391,
    "translation": "能揭去頭皮，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 17,
    "global_ayah_id": 5392,
    "translation": "能召喚轉身而逃避的人。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 18,
    "global_ayah_id": 5393,
    "translation": "他曾聚積財產而加以保藏，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 19,
    "global_ayah_id": 5394,
    "translation": "人確是被造成浮躁的，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 20,
    "global_ayah_id": 5395,
    "translation": "遭遇災殃的時候是煩惱的，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 21,
    "global_ayah_id": 5396,
    "translation": "獲得財富的時候是吝嗇的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 22,
    "global_ayah_id": 5397,
    "translation": "只有禮拜的人們，不是那樣，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 23,
    "global_ayah_id": 5398,
    "translation": "他們是常守拜功的；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 24,
    "global_ayah_id": 5399,
    "translation": "他們的財產中有一個定份，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 25,
    "global_ayah_id": 5400,
    "translation": "是用於施濟乞丐和貧民的；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 26,
    "global_ayah_id": 5401,
    "translation": "他們是承認報應之日的；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 27,
    "global_ayah_id": 5402,
    "translation": "他們是畏懼他們的主的刑罰的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 28,
    "global_ayah_id": 5403,
    "translation": "他們的主的刑罰，確是難保不降臨的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 29,
    "global_ayah_id": 5404,
    "translation": "他們是保守貞操的，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 30,
    "global_ayah_id": 5405,
    "translation": "除非對自己的妻子和奴婢，他們確是不因此而受責備的；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 31,
    "global_ayah_id": 5406,
    "translation": "凡在這個範圍之外有所要求的人，都是過份的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 32,
    "global_ayah_id": 5407,
    "translation": "他們是尊重自己所受的信托，和自己所締的盟約的；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 33,
    "global_ayah_id": 5408,
    "translation": "他們是秉公作証的；"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 34,
    "global_ayah_id": 5409,
    "translation": "他們是謹守拜功的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 35,
    "global_ayah_id": 5410,
    "translation": "這等人，是在樂園中受優待的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 36,
    "global_ayah_id": 5411,
    "translation": "不信道的人們，怎麼注視著你，三五成群的分列"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 37,
    "global_ayah_id": 5412,
    "translation": "在你的左右呢？"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 38,
    "global_ayah_id": 5413,
    "translation": "難道他們每個人都希望入恩澤的樂園嗎？"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 39,
    "global_ayah_id": 5414,
    "translation": "絕不然！我確已用他們所知道的物質創造了他們。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 40,
    "global_ayah_id": 5415,
    "translation": "不然，我以一切東方和西方的主盟誓，我確是全能的，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 41,
    "global_ayah_id": 5416,
    "translation": "我能以比他們更好的人代替他們，我不是無能的。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 42,
    "global_ayah_id": 5417,
    "translation": "你應當任他們妄談，任他們遊戲，直到他們看到他們所被警告的日子。"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 43,
    "global_ayah_id": 5418,
    "translation": "在那日，他們將從墳中出來奔走，他們好像奔到牌位一樣，"
  },
  {
    "surah_id": 70,
    "ayah_number": 44,
    "global_ayah_id": 5419,
    "translation": "同時，他們身遭凌辱，不敢仰視。那是他們被警告的日子。"
  }
]